    {
      "id": "46554028-98d0-4bd5-aa02-a19bcde5577e",
      "name": "Analyze Receipt Photo with Gemini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "position": [
        2192,
        464
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "Analyze this receipt or invoice and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nExtract:\n- vendor\n- amount: final total paid\n- date: YYYY-MM-DD\n- category: category must be one of:\n\n- Food: groceries, supermarkets, restaurants, cafes, food delivery, drinks\n- Transport: public transport, taxi, fuel, parking\n- Shopping: clothes, electronics, household goods, non-food retail\n- Services: subscriptions, repairs, professional or personal services\n- Other: anything else\n\nImportant:\nSupermarkets and grocery stores must be classified as \"Food\", not \"Shopping\".\n\n- payment_method: Credit card or Cash\n- confidence: 0 to 1\n\nReturn EXACTLY one JSON object in this structure:\n\n{\n  \"vendor\": \"string or null\",\n  \"amount\": 0,\n  \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"category\": \"string\",\n  \"payment_method\": \"Credit card\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.95\n}\n\nRules:\n- Receipt may be in any language.\n- If vendor is unknown, use null.\n- If amount or date is unknown, use 0.\n- If category is unclear, use \"Other\".\n- Do not invent values.\n- Lower confidence if information is unclear or missing.\n- Output must be parseable by JSON.parse().\n- Use double quotes for all JSON keys and string values.\n- Do not use single quotes.\n- Do not add comments.\n- Do not add trailing commas.\n- Do not wrap the JSON in markdown or code fences.\n- Do not write any text before or after the JSON.\n- Return exactly one JSON object and nothing else.\n- If uncertain, still return the same JSON structure using null, 0, \"Other\", and a lower confidence value.\n- RETURN ONLY VALID JSON.",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "",
          "cachedResultUrl": "",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "options": {},
        "resource": "image",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "operation": "analyze"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
